 ### Added
 
+- Queues and tickets persistence: `queues` (entity FK cascade, per-entity unique slug, `is_active`, `labels_i18n`) and `tickets` (queue FK cascade, `(queue_id, code)` unique, priority default 0, `waiting`/`called` status, no cancelled state) migrations with a `(queue_id, status, priority, issued_at)` index.
+- `App\Models\Queue` and `App\Models\Ticket` (write-once save guard, `nextCode` sequence, single `call()`), enums `TicketStatus`/`TicketChannel` and `App\Exceptions\InactiveQueueException`.
+- Invokable `App\Actions\IssueTicket`: transactional issuance that re-reads the queue state under lock, allocates the per-queue display code (`A001`, `A002`, ... insertion-ordered, skips malformed legacy codes, retries on `(queue_id, code)` collisions) and rejects inactive queues / negative priority with nothing persisted.
+- `Queue::factory()` and `Ticket::factory()` (sequential code allocation, `forQueue()`, `called()` state).
+
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
